Maolan plugins are a collection of CLAP plugins which currently includes:
- drust: A DrumGizmo-inspired drum sampler plugin.
- rural-modeler: A guitar amp modeler based on NAM and IR.
- EQ: parametric and graphic
- maximizer: adaptive clipper/limiter with Vintage and Modern variants
- imager: stereo width processor with Mild, Wide, and Aggressive algorithms
- monitoring: monitoring toolbox with 17 modes
- saturator: waveshape saturation
